      "serverInfo": {
        "name": "notes-memory",
        "version": "4.1.3"
      },
      "instructions": "Resolve scope explicitly with memory_scope. Use spaces_list to find space IDs. Supply an explicit space for a new repository. Existing repository identities keep their registered space. Follow the returned search_scopes: projects search their own memory and the shared memory in their space. Search first, then read only relevant notes. At task end, best-effort save project facts to that project and shared facts to the returned shared_project; never save secrets or transcripts. Live evidence wins. Ordinary notes_write requires an explicit user request. Bulk imports require explicit authorization. Reads cap content at max_tokens UTF-8 bytes. Continue with next_offset and the same checksum as expected_checksum; truncated reads are not full-file replacements. Ordinary updates retain prior versions in hidden .notes-history directories. An updated-with-conflict result retains a racing native edit as a readable Conflicts note; reconcile it before writing again."
    }
  },
